ltern und strengt sich immer ganz besonders an, allen Leuten in seinem Leben zu helfen – außer sich selbst, um sein eigenes Leben zu verbessern. Julio arbeitet bei einer wohltätigen Organisation, die jungen Latinos im Süden von Los Angeles dabei helfen soll, von ihren Gangs loszukommen. Zeitgleich versucht er, die Abhängigkeit von seiner Familie zu überwinden.","poster":"/eKpS0ZPucYjmof4yh5NrDULsDXK.jpg","runtime":30.0,"title":"This Fool","type":"series","va":7.4,"vc":48,"year":"2022"},"tv:206818":{"cast":[],"genres":["Dokumentarfilm"],"id":206818,"original":"The Murders Before the Marathon","overview":"","poster":"/lpYEAjgZn47g8RSJc4pVLfQr2e7.jpg","runtime":44.0,"title":"The Murders Before the Marathon","type":"series","va":3.3,"vc":3,"year":"2022"},"tv:207707":{"cast":[{"id":1977,"name":"Richard Bohringer","photo":"/v6372ku0d2Y28zUJ7mGrwaNQ04g.jpg"},{"id":185374,"name":"Astrid Veillon","photo":"/1hA8L2NdWw07mLpV2gYAYAvlfdw.jpg"},{"id":1923508,"name":"François Bourcier","photo":"/AlcTlBhrB12QhYnn1uBh2bs4Tro.jpg"},{"id":35203,"name":"Olivia Brunaux","photo":"/yA9ZmGfbzD84QHiuQvyNLODzsJb.jpg"},{"id":64543,"name":"Julien Cafaro","photo":"/x4bT88sXRoSe7VKZEOAVpVkhSTP.jpg"},{"id":83847,"name":"Annie Grégorio","photo":"/tFUFClD131oofGdXnjdNzpzZlvg.jpg"},{"id":24563,"name":"Philippe Magnan","photo":"/xwOB9jsFn3koHGuLiWuTou0tnrE.jpg"},{"id":585021,"name":"Richaud Valls","photo":"/A77DnnzD17kIYO5ZjAa3HjqCU4H.jpg"}],"genres":["Drama"],"id":207707,"original":"Un homme en colère","overview":"","poster":"/hljCcXFTBjHbe0C22lLL5KyvUFv.jpg","runtime":90.0,"title":"Un homme en colère","type":"series","va":0.0,"vc":0,"year":"1997"},"tv:218538":{"cast":[{"id":1299351,"name":"Lee Min-ki","photo":"/cS9o926nFrFaiWPGUXC07gSFGTA.jpg"},{"id":2987023,"name":"한지현","photo":"/vtcti64Em6Gc9tDLsLNbeB4Mwds.jpg"},{"id":1330446,"name":"이이경","photo":"/rAH9iQ6olF5cyVKkVQuoGyaFxK.jpg"},{"id":1572347,"name":"Jeon Bae-soo","photo":"/7EhOO3xFN5FvEJwl0b0Eudab5bI.jpg"},{"id":4365677,"name":"이승룡","photo":"/